API Documentation for Frontend Developers
1. Introduction
This document provides all the necessary information to interact with the CGL Service Backend API. It covers authentication, standard response formats, and detailed descriptions of each available endpoint.
Base URL
All API endpoints are prefixed with the following base URL:
/api/v1
Authentication
Every request to a protected endpoint must include an Authorization header containing a valid JWT Bearer Token.
Header Format:
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token>
2. Standard Response Format
All API responses, whether successful or not, are wrapped in a standardized JSON object. This allows for consistent handling on the frontend.
Success Response (success: true)
When a request is successful, the data field will contain the requested resource (an object or an array).







